NOTICE OF ELECTION
Temecula Valley Unified School District
November 3, 2026
NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN to the qualified electors of the Temecula Valley
Unified School District, located in the County of Riverside, State of California, that in
accordance with applicable law, an election will be held on Tuesday, the 3rd day of
November, 2026, in the Temecula Valley Unified School District, at which election there
will be submitted to the voters the following measure:
M S
To provide safe, modern schools by repairing and
upgrading aging classrooms, school facilities, science
and career technology labs supporting college/career
readiness in math, science, engineering, technology,
arts, and skilled trades; repairing deteriorating roofs,
plumbing, gas, and electrical systems; shall Temecula
Valley Unified School District's measure be adopted
authorizing $215,000,000 in bonds at legal interest
rates, levying approximately $20 per $100,000 assessed
value (averaging $13,000,000) annually, while bonds
are outstanding, with citizen oversight, audits, and all
money locally-controlled?
Bonds Yes
Bonds No
NOTICE IS FURTHER GIVEN that arguments for and arguments against the
measure may be filed with the Registrar of Voters Office, 2720 Gateway Drive, Riverside,
CA 92507 no later than 5:00 p.m. on July 23, 2026.
NOTICE IS FURTHER GIVEN that the polls at said election will be open from 7:00
a.m. until 8:00 p.m. on the stated Election Day.
Dated: July 21, 2026
Registrar of Voters